<title>CHINA: Hsin Chong Cons year net sharply higher.</title>
<headline>Hsin Chong Cons year net sharply higher.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   17.8     vs 8.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.5	vs 4.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs 48.13 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    111.91   vs 50.86</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,819.75 vs 1,719.23</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hsin Chong Construction Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  July 24-28</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   August 26</p>
<p>NOTE - Hsin Chong Construction is a local builder.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 8.5 H.K. cents (including an interim dividend of three cents) vs 7.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
